      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON MEGAN (7) showed good early speed and led throughout to score her maiden two back then finished third last start and beaten 5.5 lengths at Q Lakeside over 457m (25.86). Will break from a wide draw. Rates highly here and will give a sight again. BRUNSWICK BOY (6) ran below his best last time finishing fifth (23.97) over 411m at this track in a Grade 5. Solid record here at this trip including three wins. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Worth following up. TRIZLA (2) was in the minors two back (17.13) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 8th. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts. Must be included in calculations. MAY DUTTON (1) looks an each-way chance.",
